  "zh": "# 今日科技与行业热点：DeepSeek故障、OpenAI撤论文、手机涨价\n## AI 与科技\n- **DeepSeek 抽风 原因曝光**：模型推理异常引发广泛讨论，凸显大模型稳定性挑战。\n- **OpenAI 撤回 3篇 数学论文**：撤回原因涉及数据错误，提醒学术严谨性在AI时代的重要性。\n- **人造太阳 核聚变 发电**：新进展显示可控核聚变离实际应用更近一步，可能改变能源格局。\n## 行业动向\n- **华为 小米 手机 涨价**：两大厂商均宣布涨价最高达千元，反映供应链成本上升和市场定位调整。\n- **华纳 收购 始末**：梳理华纳兄弟被收购全过程，揭示媒体行业整合趋势及其对内容生态的影响。\n## 国际视野\n- **中国 大使馆 撤离 提醒**：使馆 urging 公民尽快离动荡地区，提示海外安全形势紧张。\n- **俄 解除 不明原因 肺炎 防疫**：俄罗斯取消不明肺炎防疫措施，引发对疫情透明度和公共卫生的质疑。",
  "en": "# Today's tech and industry highlights: DeepSeek glitch exposed, OpenAI withdrew three math papers, Huawei and Xiaomi raised phone prices\n## AI & Tech\n- **DeepSeek glitch cause exposed**: Model inference anomalies sparked widespread discussion, highlighting stability challenges of large models.\n- **OpenAI withdraws three math papers**: The retractions stem from data errors, reminding us of academic rigor's importance in the AI era.\n- **Artificial sun achieves nuclear fusion power**: New progress shows controllable fusion is closer to practical use, potentially reshaping the energy landscape.\n## Industry Trends\n- **Huawei Xiaomi smartphone price increase**: Both firms announced price hikes up to a thousand yuan, reflecting rising supply-chain costs and market positioning shifts.\n- **Warner Bros acquisition overview**: A detailed look at Warner Bros.'s acquisition reveals media industry consolidation trends and their impact on content ecosystems.\n## International Outlook\n- **Chinese embassy urges evacuation**: The embassy urged citizens to leave unstable regions swiftly, signaling heightened overseas security concerns.\n- **Russia lifts防疫 measures for unexplained pneumonia**: Russia lifted防疫 measures for unexplained pneumonia, raising questions about epidemic transparency and public health."
